[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5823.99, "timestamp": "01:37:03", "text": "好的。接下来你想玩什么游戏？或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5835.91, "timestamp": "01:37:15", "text": "我只是……我只是跟着你，迪奥。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5839.99, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "text": "真没想到我居然还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.39, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "嗯，我甚至还懂一些网络迷因知识。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5850.0, "timestamp": "01:37:30", "text": "好的，我们来看看还有什么其他可能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5852.87, "timestamp": "01:37:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5855.99, "timestamp": "01:37:35", "text": "为什么不尝试改变呢？什么？我是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5858.149, "timestamp": "01:37:38", "text": "从未尝试过串联。何不试试呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5861.83, "timestamp": "01:37:41", "text": "那？我们真的可以。是的。是，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5863.75, "timestamp": "01:37:43", "text": "真是太令人沮丧了。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5866.95, "timestamp": "01:37:46", "text": "我们走吧。耶。我们走吧。链条"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5868.47, "timestamp": "01:37:48", "text": "一起。二、三、四、五"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5875.99, "timestamp": "01:37:55", "text": "M"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.83, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "我拉屎的东西在白天和晚上都有影子"}]